ith these dates falling within the past month.\n\n## Conclusion\nAll three models are verified ASR models with open-source licenses, substantial download/like counts indicating recognition, innovative features described in their model cards, and claimed creation dates within the past month. The methodology (ASR task filter + recently created sort) was sound, and all quantitative claims match the screenshots.\n\n**Verdict: SUCCESS**",
